{"title":"Cryber Video","type":"page","uid":"362c67b9653e61149e82353a07a73178","text":"Finis World 行走于世，以明灯照己，以微光暖人。 🌱 成长与学习 真正的成长，始于承认自己无知的那一刻。 学如登山，每一步皆风景；思如探渊，每深入皆见光。 保持好奇，像孩子般发问；保持坚韧，如树木般扎根。 🤝 人际与处世 与人为善，是给自己修桥；与人宽容，是给心灵让路。...","date":"2026-04-07T01:01:23.345Z","updated":"2026-04-07T01:01:23.345Z","comments":true,"path":"api/pages/projects/index.json","covers":null,"excerpt":"","content":"<h1 id=\"Finis-World\"><a href=\"#Finis-World\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"Finis World\"></a>Finis World</h1><blockquote><span class=\"custom-blockquote-svg\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-reactroot=\"\">\n<path fill=\"\" d=\"M22 12C22 6.5 17.5 2 12 2C6.5 2 2 6.5 2 12C2 17.5 6.5 22 12 22C13.8 22 15.5 21.5 17 20.6L22 22L20.7 17C21.5 15.5 22 13.8 22 12Z\" undefined=\"1\"></path>\n<path fill=\"\" d=\"M15.97 11.5H16.04C17.12 11.5 18 12.38 18 13.47V13.53C18 14.62 17.12 15.5 16.03 15.5H15.96C14.88 15.5 14 14.62 14 13.53V13.46C14 12.38 14.88 11.5 15.97 11.5Z\" undefined=\"1\"></path>\n<path fill=\"\" d=\"M7.97 11.5H8.04C9.12 11.5 10 12.38 10 13.47V13.53C10 14.62 9.12 15.5 8.03 15.5H7.97C6.88 15.5 6 14.62 6 13.53V13.46C6 12.38 6.88 11.5 7.97 11.5Z\" undefined=\"1\"></path>\n<path stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"\" d=\"M17 8.5C15.23 8.97 14.07 10.84 14.01 13.27C14 13.33 14 13.4 14 13.47V13.5\"></path>\n<path stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"\" d=\"M9 8.5C7.23 8.97 6.07 10.84 6.01 13.27C6 13.33 6 13.4 6 13.47V13.5\"></path>\n<path stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"\" d=\"M15.97 11.5H16.04C17.12 11.5 18 12.38 18 13.47V13.53C18 14.62 17.12 15.5 16.03 15.5H15.96C14.88 15.5 14 14.62 14 13.53V13.46C14 12.38 14.88 11.5 15.97 11.5Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"\" d=\"M7.97 11.5H8.04C9.12 11.5 10 12.38 10 13.47V13.53C10 14.62 9.12 15.5 8.03 15.5H7.97C6.88 15.5 6 14.62 6 13.53V13.46C6 12.38 6.88 11.5 7.97 11.5Z\"></path>\n</svg>\n</span><p>行走于世，以明灯照己，以微光暖人。</p></blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h3 id=\"🌱-成长与学习\"><a href=\"#🌱-成长与学习\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"🌱 成长与学习\"></a>🌱 成长与学习</h3><ul>\n<li>真正的成长，始于承认自己无知的那一刻。</li>\n<li>学如登山，每一步皆风景；思如探渊，每深入皆见光。</li>\n<li>保持好奇，像孩子般发问；保持坚韧，如树木般扎根。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"🤝-人际与处世\"><a href=\"#🤝-人际与处世\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"🤝 人际与处世\"></a>🤝 人际与处世</h3><ul>\n<li>与人为善，是给自己修桥；与人宽容，是给心灵让路。</li>\n<li>倾听比诉说更需要智慧，理解比评判更显胸怀。</li>\n<li>珍惜缘分，但不过度依附；保持独立，却不冷漠疏离。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"💪-心态与韧性\"><a href=\"#💪-心态与韧性\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"💪 心态与韧性\"></a>💪 心态与韧性</h3><ul>\n<li>困境是生命的刻刀，它雕琢形状，但你决定最终的模样。</li>\n<li>允许自己脆弱，但永不放弃站起的勇气。</li>\n<li>真正的强大，是看清生活的真相后，依然选择热爱。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"🚀-行动与创造\"><a href=\"#🚀-行动与创造\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"🚀 行动与创造\"></a>🚀 行动与创造</h3><ul>\n<li>梦想是星空，行动是阶梯。仰望之后，请务必攀爬。</li>\n<li>完成比完美更重要。先让事情发生，再让它变得更好。</li>\n<li>你创造价值的方式，定义了你是谁。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"⏳-时间与生命\"><a href=\"#⏳-时间与生命\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"⏳ 时间与生命\"></a>⏳ 时间与生命</h3><ul>\n<li>时间如雨，既能滋养万物，也能冲刷一切。请用心灌溉你的土地。</li>\n<li>过去是书，可阅不可居；未来是画，可绘不可惧；当下是礼，需亲手开启。</li>\n<li>生命的意义不在长度，而在深度与温度。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"🌍-自我与宇宙\"><a href=\"#🌍-自我与宇宙\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"🌍 自我与宇宙\"></a>🌍 自我与宇宙</h3><ul>\n<li>认识自己是终身课题：知所爱，明所惧，安于独处，乐于共融。</li>\n<li><strong>为生活做减法</strong>：减少物欲、杂念与无效社交，心灵才有空间呼吸。</li>\n<li>你即是宇宙的缩影，怀揣星空，脚踏实地。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<blockquote><span class=\"custom-blockquote-svg\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-reactroot=\"\">\n<path fill=\"\" d=\"M22 12C22 6.5 17.5 2 12 2C6.5 2 2 6.5 2 12C2 17.5 6.5 22 12 22C13.8 22 15.5 21.5 17 20.6L22 22L20.7 17C21.5 15.5 22 13.8 22 12Z\" undefined=\"1\"></path>\n<path fill=\"\" d=\"M15.97 11.5H16.04C17.12 11.5 18 12.38 18 13.47V13.53C18 14.62 17.12 15.5 16.03 15.5H15.96C14.88 15.5 14 14.62 14 13.53V13.46C14 12.38 14.88 11.5 15.97 11.5Z\" undefined=\"1\"></path>\n<path fill=\"\" d=\"M7.97 11.5H8.04C9.12 11.5 10 12.38 10 13.47V13.53C10 14.62 9.12 15.5 8.03 15.5H7.97C6.88 15.5 6 14.62 6 13.53V13.46C6 12.38 6.88 11.5 7.97 11.5Z\" undefined=\"1\"></path>\n<path stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"\" d=\"M17 8.5C15.23 8.97 14.07 10.84 14.01 13.27C14 13.33 14 13.4 14 13.47V13.5\"></path>\n<path stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"\" d=\"M9 8.5C7.23 8.97 6.07 10.84 6.01 13.27C6 13.33 6 13.4 6 13.47V13.5\"></path>\n<path stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"\" d=\"M15.97 11.5H16.04C17.12 11.5 18 12.38 18 13.47V13.53C18 14.62 17.12 15.5 16.03 15.5H15.96C14.88 15.5 14 14.62 14 13.53V13.46C14 12.38 14.88 11.5 15.97 11.5Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"\" d=\"M7.97 11.5H8.04C9.12 11.5 10 12.38 10 13.47V13.53C10 14.62 9.12 15.5 8.03 15.5H7.97C6.88 15.5 6 14.62 6 13.53V13.46C6 12.38 6.88 11.5 7.97 11.5Z\"></path>\n</svg>\n</span><p><strong>最后一句，留给你自己书写。</strong><br>你的道路，你的领悟，你选择如何定义这一程。<br>愿你：清醒而温柔，坚定且自由。</p></blockquote>\n<hr>\n","count_time":{"symbolsCount":598,"symbolsTime":"1 mins."},"toc":"<ol class=\"toc\"><li class=\"toc-item toc-level-1\"><a class=\"toc-link\" href=\"#Finis-World\"><span class=\"toc-text\">Finis World</span></a><ol class=\"toc-child\"><li class=\"toc-item toc-level-3\"><a class=\"toc-link\" href=\"#%F0%9F%8C%B1-%E6%88%90%E9%95%BF%E4%B8%8E%E5%AD%A6%E4%B9%A0\"><span class=\"toc-text\">🌱 成长与学习</span></a></li><li class=\"toc-item toc-level-3\"><a class=\"toc-link\" href=\"#%F0%9F%A4%9D-%E4%BA%BA%E9%99%85%E4%B8%8E%E5%A4%84%E4%B8%96\"><span class=\"toc-text\">🤝 人际与处世</span></a></li><li class=\"toc-item toc-level-3\"><a class=\"toc-link\" href=\"#%F0%9F%92%AA-%E5%BF%83%E6%80%81%E4%B8%8E%E9%9F%A7%E6%80%A7\"><span class=\"toc-text\">💪 心态与韧性</span></a></li><li class=\"toc-item toc-level-3\"><a class=\"toc-link\" href=\"#%F0%9F%9A%80-%E8%A1%8C%E5%8A%A8%E4%B8%8E%E5%88%9B%E9%80%A0\"><span class=\"toc-text\">🚀 行动与创造</span></a></li><li class=\"toc-item toc-level-3\"><a class=\"toc-link\" href=\"#%E2%8F%B3-%E6%97%B6%E9%97%B4%E4%B8%8E%E7%94%9F%E5%91%BD\"><span class=\"toc-text\">⏳ 时间与生命</span></a></li><li class=\"toc-item toc-level-3\"><a class=\"toc-link\" href=\"#%F0%9F%8C%8D-%E8%87%AA%E6%88%91%E4%B8%8E%E5%AE%87%E5%AE%99\"><span class=\"toc-text\">🌍 自我与宇宙</span></a></li></ol></li></ol></li></ol>","data":[]}